- Inspect returned evidence before choosing follow-up searches; do not spend the full budget when the question is
  already adequately supported.

## Source contract

- Include every used source in `sources`.
- Connect every finding to its supporting `source_ids`.
- Preserve specific dates, figures, caveats, and disagreements in `evidence` and `narrative_notes`.
- Use an empty list when there are no gaps or caveats.

